silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_06_crdt_gossip_convergence_sections_01_crdt_gossip_concrete_anchor_r1 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.06_crdt_gossip_convergence.sections.01_crdt_gossip.concrete_anchor.r1" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_06_crdt_gossip_convergence_sections_01_crdt_gossip_concrete_anchor_r1 silm:hasLongDescription "The SensorReplica1VetRecord is R_1 is the first replica — the data node on sensor server 1 holding a copy of Mittens's StoragePacket. It contains: vaccination date (2025-01-15), weight (3.6 kg at last reading), breed (domestic shorthair). R_1 emits Delta_1 when a new weight reading arrives." .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_06_crdt_gossip_convergence_sections_01_crdt_gossip_concrete_anchor_delta1 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.06_crdt_gossip_convergence.sections.01_crdt_gossip.concrete_anchor.delta1" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_06_crdt_gossip_convergence_sections_01_crdt_gossip_concrete_anchor_delta1 silm:hasLongDescription "The WeightUpdateDeltaForMittens is Delta_1 is the typed change packet: {weight: 3.8kg, timestamp: 2026-05-18T09:30, about: Mittens, sensorID: vet-clinic-scale-01}. It carries the aboutness marker. It is NOT a storage string — it is a typed information object with declared subject (Mittens), operation kind (weight update), and witness condition (vet clinic scale reading)." .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_06_crdt_gossip_convergence_sections_01_crdt_gossip_concrete_anchor_r2_merged a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.06_crdt_gossip_convergence.sections.01_crdt_gossip.concrete_anchor.r2_merged" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_06_crdt_gossip_convergence_sections_01_crdt_gossip_concrete_anchor_r2_merged silm:hasLongDescription "The Replica2AfterMerge is R_2 join Delta_1 is the state of replica R_2 after incorporating Delta_1. It now holds: vaccination date (from original R_2), weight 3.8 kg (from Delta_1), breed (from original R_2). The merge adds the new weight without removing any existing data. The cocone leg lambda_gossip from this state to Mittens is the same as from R_1." .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_06_crdt_gossip_convergence_sections_01_crdt_gossip_concrete_anchor_mittens_apex a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.06_crdt_gossip_convergence.sections.01_crdt_gossip.concrete_anchor.mittens_apex" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_06_crdt_gossip_convergence_sections_01_crdt_gossip_concrete_anchor_mittens_apex silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensGovernedIndividualInGossip is Mittens is the instancenode in the gossip diagram — the governed individual that every replica and every delta is about. The cocone legs lambda_gossip from R_1 and from R_2 join Delta_1 both point here. Mittens is the semantic anchor; the replicas and deltas are storage objects about Mittens, not Mittens itself." .
